sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  title: Outbox retry and ACK
  participant A as Sender AI
  participant T as postal_send Tool
  participant K as Outbox KV
  participant R as Retry Scanner
  participant B as Peer Session

  A->>T: postal_send letter
  T->>K: write pending record (sender-scoped)
  T->>T: sign letter (HMAC)
  T->>T: check send/task grant
  alt grant inactive
    T->>K: mark revoked
  else grant active
    T->>B: attempt steer
  alt delivery succeeds
    T->>K: mark delivered
    B->>T: prompt admission hook
    alt receiver accepts
      B->>K: write accepted receipt
      B->>T: reply with reply_to
      T->>K: mark acked
    else receiver rejects
      B->>K: write rejected receipt
      T->>K: reconcile to rejected
    end
  else delivery fails
    T->>K: pending with backoff
    loop every 15 seconds
      R->>K: list due pending records (parallel)
      R->>B: retry steer
      alt retry succeeds
        R->>K: mark delivered
      else attempts below six
        R->>K: schedule next backoff
      else attempts exhausted
        R->>K: mark failed
      end
    end
  end
  end
